   {"emoji":"🏙️","titulo":"Puerto Natales — Dezember 2024","desc":"Puerto Natales, Chile. Serrano- und Penitente-Flüsse mit WQI Gut–Ausgezeichnet (84–89).","path":"assets/campo/03_puerto_natales_dez2024.jpg","legenda":"Puerto Natales · Chile · Dezember 2024 · WQI 84–89","coords":"51.7°S · 72.5°W","iqa":"84–89 (Gut)","mes":"Dez/2024","cor":"#2D5A32"},
